<title>USA: United National Q1 net up before charge.</title>
<headline>United National Q1 net up before charge.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEWATER, N.J. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		    $0.70</p>
<p> Net		   3,450,000,	     $3,043,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is United National Bancorp.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net excludes one-time merger-related charge of $1,072,000, or $0.25 per share, net of taxes, for the aqcuisition of Farrington Bank.</p>
<p>United National Bancorp is the parent of United National Bank.</p>
